B.a1s=new A.bQ(B.iw,["How do I get assigned to a job?",'Jobs are assigned by the tenant administrator. Once assigned, you\'ll receive a push notification and the job will appear in your "My Jobs" section. Make sure your notifications are enabled for timely updates.'],t.C)
B.a1v=new A.bQ(B.iw,["How are my ratings calculated?","Your rating is the average of all ratings given by tenants after each completed job. Ratings range from 1 to 5 stars. We recommend completing jobs promptly and professionally to maintain a high rating."],t.C)
B.a1w=new A.bQ(B.iw,["What happens if I can't complete a job?","If you're unable to complete an assigned job, contact the tenant directly and inform your platform administrator as soon as possible. Frequent cancellations may affect your account standing."],t.C)
B.a1t=new A.bQ(B.iw,["How do I update my skills or profile?","Go to Settings \u2192 My Skills & Experience to update your skill category, years of experience, and specializations. For profile photo and personal details, use Settings \u2192 Edit Profile."],t.C)
B.a1u=new A.bQ(B.iw,["When will I receive payment for completed jobs?","Payment schedules are determined by the tenant organization you work with. Please contact your assigned tenant administrator for payment-related queries. The platform does not directly handle provider payments."],t.C)
B.a1x=new A.bQ(B.iw,["How do I report a problem with a booking?",'Use the "Send Us a Message" form above to describe the booking issue, including the booking ID and date. Our support team will investigate and respond within 2\u20134 business hours.'],t.C)
